t jesse pinkman and  sees an opportunity to partner up with  his former student to cook math to pay  his medical bills and leave something  for his family he approaches jesse and  they both agree to work together and  combine their talents chorality mirrored  images  right  active inactive  good bad while things don't exactly go  smoothly at first walter and jesse do  manage to successfully sell math and  soon begin cooking in an old rv out in  the desert the pair eventually run into  tuco salamanca and enter into a  partnership with him to distribute the  drugs as the relationship worsens they  eventually end up meeting hector  salamanca and are set to be killed by  tuko however hank arrives and  unknowingly saves the two rookie cooks  and kills tuko in a shootout  with tuko salamanca no longer a problem  walter and jesse have an opportunity to  expand and take over the role of  distributors jesse teams up with skinny  pete and badger to start selling them at  themselves and they see a good amount of  success at first jesse even develops an  undeserved reputation for being a  cold-blooded killer making it easier for  his gang to collect money from dealers  it changes in their personal  circumstances make things more difficult  for them to continue cooking math skylar  becomes increasingly suspicious of  walter and what he's doing in his spare  time when she discovers he has a second  phone she initially suspects he may be  having an affair eventually she  discovers that he has been lying about  getting money from his former business  partners to pay for his medical bills  around the same time jesse enters a  relationship with jane margulis and they  start using drugs regularly in need of a  lawyer to get badger off the hook after  a sting operation walter and jesse go to  saul goodman he's able to help them get  badger a lighter sentence when he is  arrested and comes up with a plan to  make their extra income seem legitimate  after some discussion he puts him in  